// House and per-circuit summary for the UI (energy.rules "Energy: today and this month").
// Computed from InfluxDB every minute, so they are not persisted.
Number EnergyToday_kWh  "Used today [%.2f kWh]"      <energy>
Number EnergyToday_Cost "Cost today [%.2f €]"        <price>
Number EnergyMonth_kWh  "Used this month [%.1f kWh]" <energy>
Number EnergyMonth_Cost "Cost this month [%.2f €]"   <price>
Number EnergyMeter10_TodayKwh  "Hob right today [%.2f kWh]"      <energy> (Line10)
Number EnergyMeter10_TodayCost "Hob right cost today [%.2f €]"   <price>  (Line10)
Number EnergyMeter10_MonthKwh  "Hob right this month [%.1f kWh]" <energy> (Line10)
Number EnergyMeter10_MonthCost "Hob right cost this month [%.2f €]" <price> (Line10)
Number EnergyMeter11_TodayKwh  "Hob left today [%.2f kWh]"      <energy> (Line11)
Number EnergyMeter11_TodayCost "Hob left cost today [%.2f €]"   <price>  (Line11)
Number EnergyMeter11_MonthKwh  "Hob left this month [%.1f kWh]" <energy> (Line11)
Number EnergyMeter11_MonthCost "Hob left cost this month [%.2f €]" <price> (Line11)
Number EnergyMeter2_TodayKwh  "Living, kitchen, shed, hall & WC today [%.2f kWh]"      <energy> (Line2)
Number EnergyMeter2_TodayCost "Living, kitchen, shed, hall & WC cost today [%.2f €]"   <price>  (Line2)
Number EnergyMeter2_MonthKwh  "Living, kitchen, shed, hall & WC this month [%.1f kWh]" <energy> (Line2)
Number EnergyMeter2_MonthCost "Living, kitchen, shed, hall & WC cost this month [%.2f €]" <price> (Line2)
Number EnergyMeter3_TodayKwh  "Oven + master bedroom, bath, bergkast today [%.2f kWh]"      <energy> (Line3)
Number EnergyMeter3_TodayCost "Oven + master bedroom, bath, bergkast cost today [%.2f €]"   <price>  (Line3)
Number EnergyMeter3_MonthKwh  "Oven + master bedroom, bath, bergkast this month [%.1f kWh]" <energy> (Line3)
Number EnergyMeter3_MonthCost "Oven + master bedroom, bath, bergkast cost this month [%.2f €]" <price> (Line3)
Number EnergyMeter4_TodayKwh  "Washer & dryer today [%.2f kWh]"      <energy> (Line4)
Number EnergyMeter4_TodayCost "Washer & dryer cost today [%.2f €]"   <price>  (Line4)
Number EnergyMeter4_MonthKwh  "Washer & dryer this month [%.1f kWh]" <energy> (Line4)
Number EnergyMeter4_MonthCost "Washer & dryer cost this month [%.2f €]" <price> (Line4)
Number EnergyMeter5_TodayKwh  "Landing, Lu's room, attic office, MV today [%.2f kWh]"      <energy> (Line5)
Number EnergyMeter5_TodayCost "Landing, Lu's room, attic office, MV cost today [%.2f €]"   <price>  (Line5)
Number EnergyMeter5_MonthKwh  "Landing, Lu's room, attic office, MV this month [%.1f kWh]" <energy> (Line5)
Number EnergyMeter5_MonthCost "Landing, Lu's room, attic office, MV cost this month [%.2f €]" <price> (Line5)
